#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libdaemon.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>libdaemon</application> package is a lightweight C library "
"that eases the writing of UNIX daemons."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>libdaemon</application> é uma biblioteca C leve que "
"facilita a escrita de processos de segundo plano UNIX."

